---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | EBT Places" desc="Privacy policy for ebtplaces.com: we collect no personal, benefit, or eligibility information.">
<main class="wrap">
  <h1 style="font-size:1.6rem">Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lede">You can use this site without registering or providing any personal information.</p>
  <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
  <p>We never ask for your name, EBT number, benefit details, income, disability status, or housing situation. The restaurant search runs entirely in your browser.</p>
  <h2>Technical data</h2>
  <p>Our server keeps standard technical logs (IP, page, browser) for security, deleted periodically.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>We display ads (Google AdSense). Google may use cookies per its policies: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="nofollow noopener">policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.</p>
  <h2>Maps</h2>
  <p>Restaurant pages embed Google Maps; Google receives your IP when the map loads. Your location is never sent to or stored by us.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>info@ebtplaces.com</p>
</main>
</Base>
